        "rationale": "Acknowledge the concern and arrange prompt, individualized review with the neurology and obstetric prescribers. Current specialist guidance cautions against stopping or changing antiseizure medication without clinician review because the plan must balance medication exposure with seizure control. Imaging, precautions, or waiting for recurrence cannot substitute for resolving the interruption, and the nurse should not prescribe a restart schedule.",
