      "objective": "Select immediate observations and ongoing surveillance after uncomplicated amniotomy",
      "stem": "A patient at 39 weeks has an uncomplicated amniotomy during labor. The fluid is clear, maternal temperature is normal and the fetal tracing is reassuring. The current GBS screening result is negative, and no other antibiotic indication is present. Which actions belong in the nursing care plan from the time of rupture through the remaining labor? Select all that apply.",
