          "The current feed is continued only as a due ordered feed during prompt reassessment; the item does not imply that the existing regimen should remain unchanged after review.",
          "Each SATA option is independently judged: effective comfort care, focused assessment, interim order adherence, medication initiation, altered feeding interval, and caloric adjustment are distinct decisions."
