      "stem": "A 3-hour-old infant of a parent with diabetes had an initial low glucose that improved after feeding. The infant now has recurrent apnea, a weak suck, and a bedside glucose of 28 mg/dL. Airway support is underway, but a standing feeding order remains active. What should the nurse advocate for next?",
