      "objective": "Recognize a fetal alcohol syndrome pattern and select realistic newborn and family support",
      "stem": "A growth-restricted newborn with documented prenatal alcohol exposure has a flat midface, smooth philtrum, thin upper lip, poor suck, and marked sensitivity to light and sound. Cardiorespiratory findings are stable, and the interprofessional team is evaluating for fetal alcohol spectrum disorder. Which nursing plan best addresses the newborn's current and longer-term needs?",
