      "stem": "During a trial of labor after cesarean, a patient develops sudden persistent fetal bradycardia, loss of fetal station, constant abdominal pain, pulse 132/min, and blood pressure 86/50 mm Hg. Oxytocin has been stopped, IV access is patent, and the emergency team is arriving. Which handoff best communicates the priority?",
