        "rationale": "For this stable routine assessment, count respirations before touching the child and observe for a full minute. Beginning with temperature, pulse, or equipment can change the resting pattern. This sequence is not an emergency rule: visible distress or deterioration would require immediate assessment and intervention rather than preserving the routine order.",
