        "rationale": "The course teaches continued hCG monitoring after gestational trophoblastic disease. The newest value rises after a prior decline, so the nurse should identify the reversal, report it promptly, and reinforce continued prescribed surveillance pending clinician direction. Calling the series an uninterrupted decline, labeling it a plateau, or waiting for another scheduled result fails to act on the new reversal.",
